    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cHeir to the Throne (HttT)</strong> is an action role-playing game which borrows from the hack\u2019n\u2019slay and rogue-lite genres with a bit of extraction gameplay added to the mixture. It's played in a top-down perspective and you control your character directly: no point and click but WASD and mouse. It is being developed for cooperative multiplayer mode, but will also be playable in single player \u2013 albeit with an increased difficulty level. Other features include 'no fixed classes', 'randomised loot', 'randomised skills', 'randomised dungeons', 'permadeath', 'meta progression' and more!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Single- &amp; Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you can play the game as a solo player, HttT also offers cooperative multiplayer mode. In the joint fight against evil, coordinate the use of your skills wisely to create synergies. Exchange found items to strengthen your party\u2019s fighting power. While death might be inevitable, having teammates offers the rare chance to get revived.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Character Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the approach of &quot;you are what you wear,&quot; meaning no predefined hero classes, you have total freedom over how you want to equip and play your character. In addition, with our weapon-based random skill system we make sure that the game unfolds differently every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various hostile biomes with open landscapes and dungeons. These environments will be randomly generated every time you start a game. The biomes differ in terms of style, appearance and dominant culture - also regarding the enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Direct Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We focus on direct controls, implemented for an action-oriented and dynamic gaming experience. Instead of using point-and-click to move your character, we rely on WASD for movement as well as precise aiming with the mouse. Controller support is planned as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have created a strong basis for the game, but we need your input for new ideas and improvements: What feature would you like to see, what should we focus on or prioritize next? Wishlist the game, join our Discord and help shape the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cHeir to the Throne (HttT)</strong> is an action role-playing game which borrows from the hack\u2019n\u2019slay and rogue-lite genres with a bit of extraction gameplay added to the mixture. It's played in a top-down perspective and you control your character directly: no point and click but WASD and mouse. It is being developed for cooperative multiplayer mode, but will also be playable in single player \u2013 albeit with an increased difficulty level. Other features include 'no fixed classes', 'randomised loot', 'randomised skills', 'randomised dungeons', 'permadeath', 'meta progression' and more!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/8dba649ceb6d9b32438c6be7f160760a.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Single- &amp; Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you can play the game as a solo player, HttT also offers cooperative multiplayer mode. In the joint fight against evil, coordinate the use of your skills wisely to create synergies. Exchange found items to strengthen your party\u2019s fighting power. While death might be inevitable, having teammates offers the rare chance to get revived.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/b65b3e845d059c013de74d1a73915967.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Character Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the approach of &quot;you are what you wear,&quot; meaning no predefined hero classes, you have total freedom over how you want to equip and play your character. In addition, with our weapon-based random skill system we make sure that the game unfolds differently every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/511ec59aa5d2c0e523ec527426d712e0.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various hostile biomes with open landscapes and dungeons. These environments will be randomly generated every time you start a game. The biomes differ in terms of style, appearance and dominant culture - also regarding the enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.poster.avif?t=1748356453\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.webm?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065870/extras/1b9a1b9c6131593fbe903ec42ffad431.mp4?t=1748356453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Direct Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We focus on direct controls, implemented for an action-oriented and dynamic gaming experience. Instead of using point-and-click to move your character, we rely on WASD for movement as well as precise aiming with the mouse. Controller support is planned as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have created a strong basis for the game, but we need your input for new ideas and improvements: What feature would you like to see, what should we focus on or prioritize next? Wishlist the game, join our Discord and help shape the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Experience co-op action in Heir to the Throne, a rogue-lite game set in a procedurally generated world! Battle hordes of monsters, discover weapons with random skills, and combine your team's abilities strategically. Through smart teamwork you can claim the throne and fulfill your destiny!",
